WEBVTT

00:14:58.089 --> 00:15:00.788
The screens are getting smaller,
people are illuminating,

00:15:00.812 --> 00:15:02.209
putting manuals in the boxes,

00:15:02.233 --> 00:15:04.976
things are coming out at a faster pace.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.393
It's funny -- when Steve Jobs
came back to Apple in 1997,

00:15:08.417 --> 00:15:11.242
after 12 years away,
it was the MacWorld Expo --

00:15:11.266 --> 00:15:14.408
he came to the stage
in that black turtleneck and jeans,

00:15:14.432 --> 00:15:15.584
and he sort of did this.

00:15:15.608 --> 00:15:17.976
The crowd went wild,
but I had just seen --

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.926
I'm like, where have I seen this before?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.759
I had just seen the movie "Evita" --

00:15:21.783 --> 00:15:24.868
(Laughter)

00:15:24.892 --> 00:15:26.050
with Madonna,

00:15:26.074 --> 00:15:27.822
and I'm like, you know what?

00:15:27.846 --> 00:15:30.943
I've got to do one about Steve Jobs.